<view wx:if="{{target}}" class="sheet-backdrop"><view class="sheet"><view class="sheet-heading"><text>{{target.title}}</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="close" disabled="{{busy}}">返回会话</button></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="review-content"><text selectable class="review-detail">{{target.detail}}</text><text class="muted review-note">{{target.stage === 'prepare' ? '本次只准备原待审操作，尚未批准或执行。' : target.stage === 'decision' ? '批准只保存这一个原审批决定，执行还需独立确认；用户文字不代替审批。' : target.stage === 'reconcile' ? '本次仅查询原操作和远端回执，不上传、不补写、不再次创建或发布。' : '本次只执行已批准的这一原作用域；结果未知时只读核对，不自动重试外部写入。'}}</text><checkbox-group bindchange="consent" class="draft-consents"><view wx:if="{{target.stage === 'prepare' || target.stage === 'decision'}}"><label wx:if="{{target.action === 'draft'}}"><checkbox value="draft" checked="{{draftChecked}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain || !target.allowConfirm}}"/>我确认只创建这一原 Shopify 草稿，不发布渠道</label><label wx:if="{{target.action === 'draft' &amp;&amp; target.hasImages}}"><checkbox value="images" checked="{{imagesChecked}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain || !target.allowConfirm}}"/>我明确允许本次上传上列已选图片；不代表 CDN 字节已核验</label><label wx:if="{{target.action === 'publish'}}"><checkbox value="publish" checked="{{publishChecked}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain || !target.allowConfirm}}"/>我明确批准此原商品在上列精确渠道发布</label><label wx:if="{{target.action === 'repair_draft'}}"><checkbox value="repair" checked="{{repairChecked}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain || !target.allowConfirm}}"/>我确认只修复上列原 DRAFT 的缺失步骤，不创建、上传或发布</label><label wx:if="{{target.action === 'repair_draft' &amp;&amp; target.observedMediaRequired}}"><checkbox value="observed" checked="{{observedChecked}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain || !target.allowConfirm}}"/>我另行批准采用上列观察到的既有媒体 ID/READY；不代表 CDN 字节核验</label></view><label wx:elif="{{target.stage === 'reconcile'}}"><checkbox value="read" checked="{{readChecked}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}"/>只读核对原回执，不补写</label><label wx:else><checkbox value="execute" checked="{{executeChecked}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain || !target.allowConfirm}}"/>{{target.stage === 'retry' ? '原审批尚未使用，我明确再次提交同一原执行请求' : '我明确执行以上已批准的原操作'}}</label></checkbox-group><text wx:if="{{serverError || error}}" class="notice" role="alert">{{serverError || error}}</text></scroll-view><view class="review-actions"><button wx:if="{{target.stage === 'decision'}}" class="secondary" bindtap="deny" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}">拒绝本次写入</button><button class="primary" bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{busy || uncertain || !target.allowConfirm || !ready}}">{{target.stage === 'prepare' ? '准备独立待审操作' : target.stage === 'decision' ? '批准这一原作用域' : target.stage === 'reconcile' ? '只读核对原结果' : target.stage === 'retry' ? '明确提交同一原请求' : '执行这一已批准操作'}}</button></view></view></view>
